<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys 1.69 mln shrs off-market.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys 1.69 mln shrs off-market.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Monday it had bought back 1.69 million shares off-market last Friday as part of its NZ$1 billion share repurchase programme.</p>
<p>It bought the shares at NZ$6.52 each from its major shareholders, Bell Atlantic Holdings and Ameritech Holdings.</p>
<p>The shares were trading on Monday morning at $6.55.</p>
</text>
